Fax Me - Send Fax From Phone allows you to turn your device into a fax machine so you can send fax documents worldwide quickly and easily.

Online Fax Service to send and receive fax from phone or tablet.
When you use Fax Me app ou can send faxes using any device that is connected to the internet (mobile smartphones and tablets), avoiding the hassle and drawbacks which are typically associated with the traditional fax machine. 

